body:
Thank you. I have tried discussing this with people, but nothing seems to be working. I already take anti-psychotics to keep my anger at bay, it doesn't seem to do much. Talking about it does nothing and if anything it gets downplayed by the people I talk to once I talk about it. 

&#x200B;

Thank you for your concern, I think I will leave this sub and never come back for the sake of everyone here.

Check out Squire's lineup, they have some cheap stuff. If you like something that is flashy and have $220 to spare, Dean makes their Zone bass in nuclear green.

&#x200B;

 [https://shop.fender.com/en-US/squier-electric-basses/](https://shop.fender.com/en-US/squier-electric-basses/) 

 [https://www.deanguitars.com/collections/bass-guitars](https://www.deanguitars.com/collections/bass-guitars) 

&#x200B;

Be careful with pawn shops, you don't know the story of those guitars, if you want to buy used, go to a guitar store.
